  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dvorka/hstr/tarball/v3.3",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/dvorka/hstr/zipball/v3.3",
  "body": "This minor HSTR release brings:\r\n\r\n- Fixed truncation of bash history file by HSTR configuration\r\n  (--show-configuration) - history size (bash HISTSIZE and HISTFILESIZE,\r\n  zsh HISTSIZE and SAVEHIST) is only increased, never decreased and\r\n  unlimited sizes are kept, also for very large values and in UTF-8\r\n  locales - thanks to @awcator\r\n- Fixed HSTR bash configuration with set -u (nounset) - unset\r\n  HISTFILESIZE and PROMPT_COMMAND no longer cause errors\r\n- Fixed TIOCSTI detection diagnostics printed to stdout - they were\r\n  appended to ~/.bashrc by --show-configuration run without a terminal\r\n  (scripts, containers) - and leaked /dev/tty file descriptor\r\n- Fixed man page rendering of the bash and zsh configuration (missing\r\n  hstrnotiocsti function body and Ctrl-r key bindings)\r\n- Added HSTR_HISTFILE environment variable with history file to be used\r\n  by HSTR instead of HISTFILE e.g. global history shared by shells with\r\n  per-shell history files - thanks to @xobes\r\n- Fixed leading space in case of empty HSTR prompt\r\n  (indent kept for non-empty prompts) - thanks to @roshal\r\n- Fixed favorites corruption and crash on empty selection\r\n- Fixed out of bounds selection access with prompt at the bottom\r\n  (PgUp/PgDn, regexp highlighting) and stale cursor after backspace\r\n- Fixed duplicate favorites when adding an existing favorite\r\n- Fixed memory leak and misleading deletion count on favorite removal\r\n- Fixed memory leak on deletion of a command from history\r\n- Fixed search pattern buffer overflow on very wide terminals and garbage\r\n  characters in the pattern after pressing unhandled special keys\r\n- Fixed prompt and search pattern with multibyte/wide characters (e.g. \"❯ \"\r\n  in HSTR_PROMPT, UTF-8 or CJK pattern): cursor position, backspace,\r\n  elided history rows and highlighting of matches - thanks to\r\n  Lukáš Brabec (@lbrabec)\r\n- Fixed memory corruption on backspace and history row eliding on very\r\n  narrow terminals\r\n- Fixed Zsh history with non-ASCII characters (e.g. \"čeština\") which was\r\n  shown, searched and inserted to the prompt in Zsh metafied encoding,\r\n  and deletion of Zsh history entries with long command duration\r\n- Added Stonking Stingray Ubuntu version support at Launchpad.\r\n- Added GitHub actions workflows to build tarball, .deb, and .rpm distros.\r\n- Fixed build on Linux distributions without ncursesw/curses.h header\r\n  (e.g. Arch Linux) - thanks to Kipras Melnikovas (@kiprasmel)\r\n\r\nBig up to @awcator @xobes @lbrabec @kipresmel  @Smoothieewastaken and @roshal for their contributions!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/compare/v3.2...v3.3\r\n\r\n* enh(TUI): 🌟 remove leading space in the HSTR promt row when the prompt is empty/\"\" by @roshal in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/567\r\n* fix(favorites): 🐞 fixing NPE crash on favorites manipulation #470 by @dvorka in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/553\r\n* fix(build): 🐞 fixing build on Linux distributions w/o ncursesw/cursesh (e.g. Arch Linux) #345 by @dvorka in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/568\r\n* feat(history): ✨ adding HSTR_HISTFILE which enables per-shell history file #547 by @dvorka in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/569\r\n* fix(history): 🐞 fixing user's Bash/Zsh history truncation in case it is set above HSTR's BP values #563 by @dvorka in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/571\r\n* fixed typos from doc\\USER-DOCUMENTATION.md by @Smoothieewastaken in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/502\r\n* fix(wide): 🐞 fixing wide characters handling end to end #533 by @dvorka in https://github.com/dvorka/hstr/pull/570\r\n\r\n\r\n[![Download HSTR](https://a.fsdn.com/con/app/sf-download-button)](https://sourceforge.net/projects/hstr/files/v.3.3/)",
